#rectsl
wall 1600 900 pixels
fit cover
duration 4
fps 30

12 7 '(
  "c" rect
    colc 110 *  rowc 110 *  xy
    76 square
    colc dup *  rowc dup *  +  sqrt
    dup  0 5 smoothstep  neg 1 +  0.05 max  0 1 clamp  0.9 *  0.1 +  alpha
    5 min  neg 5 +  5 /  0.4 pow  40 *  40 +  w
    col cols 1 - /  row rows 1 - /  over  +  0.5 *  swap drop
    4 *  ceil  4 /  pi *  rot
  ) grid
